## Tool Reference: choose_action\n\
\n\
Players respond to each pending action by calling choose_action. Respond to pending action. Blocks until an action is pending. Use choice for ID/index/yes/no, attackers/blockers for batch combat.\n\
\n\
Parameters:\n\
- choice (string): ID (\"p3\"), index (\"0\"), or yes/no. yes=mulligan/confirm, no=keep/pass.\n\
- amount (integer): Amount value (for amount actions)\n\
- amounts (array): Multiple amount values (for multi_amount)\n\
- pile (integer): Pile number: 1 or 2\n\
- text (string): Text value for GAME_CHOOSE_CHOICE (pick option by name)\n\
- mana_plan (string): Comma-separated permanent IDs to tap for mana (e.g. \"p1,p5:1\"). :N selects ability on multi-ability lands. Pool colors (RED, BLUE, etc.) only SPEND existing pool mana, not produce. Auto-tap fills remaining pips.\n\
- auto_tap (boolean): Auto-tap mana (default true). Set false with mana_plan to require complete plan.\n\
- attackers (string): Batch attack: comma-separated IDs (e.g. \"p1,p2\") or \"all\". Auto-confirms.\n\
- blockers (string): Batch block: comma-separated \"blocker:attacker\" pairs (e.g. \"p5:p1,p6:p2\"). Auto-confirms.",
